  "fingerprintThisVault": "Fingerprint opens this vault",
  "secIntro": "Everything in your vault stays on this phone, encrypted. There is no account and no server: nobody else can open it, not even us.",
  "sec1Title": "Locked right on your phone",
  "sec1Body": "Photos, notes and files are encrypted before they are saved. The app never connects to the internet: no account, no ads, no analytics.",
  "sec5Title": "While the vault is open",
  "sec5Body": "The vault locks as soon as you leave the app and after a few minutes without a touch. Lists show note titles only, secrets are masked, copied text is cleared after 60 seconds. Screenshots and recordings come out black (on iPhone through an unofficial iOS technique).",
  "secTech": "Technical details",
  "secTechBody": "Encryption: XChaCha20-Poly1305 in 64 KB chunks, a random key per item.\nKey from the password: Argon2id (phones 128 MB, computers 512 MB) combined with the Recovery Key, a 256-bit Secret Key shown as 24 BIP39 words (128 bits for libraries made before 21 Oct 2026), through HKDF-SHA256.\nPIN and biometrics: a copy of the vault key wrapped by a key in the Keychain / Android Keystore.\nCore in Rust with unsafe code forbidden; open source (GPL-3.0) at github.com/cozy-pi/cozysafe.\nNo independent security audit yet.",
